      "writtenOn": "2026-01-07T15:42:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": ".star files are used with Bazel (since that\u0027s where it came from), and there are projects using depot_tools that also use Bazel.\n\nthis formatter isn\u0027t doing it now, but seems like it should sniff shebangs.  then you could support python programs that don\u0027t use .py suffix, and lucicfg files can opt-in with `#!/usr/bin/env lucicfg`.  although that isn\u0027t a silver bullet.",
      "parentUuid": "cebe7a37_3905f4ce",
